solution-
check if you have required dependencies or  not,
if dependencies are there, then
Since Flyway detected a failed migration, you need to manually clean up the flyway_schema_history table in your MySQL database.

Run this SQL in MySQL:
--
USE order_Service_DB;
SELECT * FROM flyway_schema_history;
--

If there are failed migrations, delete them:
--
DELETE FROM flyway_schema_history WHERE success = 0;
--

you can run this in separate sql shell without downloading mysql workbench

